{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23903","headline":"荅王尚书问履道池旧桥 · 白居易","name":"荅王尚书问履道池旧桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虹梁雁齿随年换，素板朱栏逐日修。\n但恨尚书能久别，莫忘州守不频游。\n重移旧柱开中眼，乱种新花拥两头。\n李郭小船何足问，待君乘过济川舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}